---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Just Block">
    <h1>Just Block</h1>

    <p>Just Block is an Android app that blocks websites.</p>
    <p>Users can manually block websites, or load in blocklists.</p>
    <p>
        Just Block works through DNS filtering. When a user attempts to visit a
        blocked site, they will be met with a browser error.
    </p>
    <p>
        Just Block uses AdGuard's DNS server (94.140.14.14) and connects through
        DoQ (DNS over QUIC).
    </p>
    <p>
        The filtering and DoQ happens in Rust, while the rest of the app is
        written in Kotlin.
    </p>
    <p>
        Just Block is open source under a GPL 3.0 license, and the code is
        available on{" "}
        <a href="https://github.com/Just-Free-Software/just-block">Github</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        View our privacy policy <a href="/just-block/privacy-policy">here</a>
    </p>
</Layout>
